                                "sense_id": "fbabd2ce-d501-3194-ac69-fff20a9a1cfe",
                                "text": "Cowan (1957a, 1957b) has established the following CVC cognation percentages using for his 'Tami Group' only the languages classed by the present writer as constituting the Upper Tami Families."
                            },
                            {
